    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51123" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσό-πλευρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>with equal sides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλαίσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.4.19
				</span></i>
			, etc.: freq. in Geom., <i>equilateral</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίγωνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					54a
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				54e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπεδον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				55e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετράγωνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.31.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of numbers,
				<i>square</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑτερομήκης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				148a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>APo.</u>
				73a40
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πλεύρως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicom.
					<u>Ar.</u>
					2.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Rhet., of
			periods, <i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Inv.</u>
				4.3
			</span></i>.</div>
